						 <p>Hello all.</p> <p>The month of the Spanish-Speaking Wiki showcase continues with SCP-ES-029: Massive Mechanical Obitus. As the representative of the ES wiki, I and my fellow friends from your sister site hope you enjoy it.</p> <p>If you like this article or are interested in seeing others like it, check out the <a href="http://scp-int.wikidot.com/es-hub">ES-Hub</a> on the INT Wiki, which will have more translated articles for you to read.</p> 
